  "bio": "Nic LeBrun, an incredibly skilled tattoo artist located in Grants Pass, United States, specializes in illustrative realism with a particular flair for breathtaking floral designs. As the owner and lead artist at Sub Rosa Tattoo Studio, Nic is known for their extraordinary attention to detail and an uncanny ability to bring their clients' visions to life on the skin. Their adeptness in the art of tattooing is matched only by their unyielding commitment to maintaining a clean and hygienic environment, ensuring each client's experience is not only visually stunning but also safe and comfortable.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Grants Pass, Oregon, United States",
